WEBVTT

00:04.480 --> 00:05.980
Urin...

00:05.980 --> 00:09.060
She really went back to the Sea, huh?

00:09.060 --> 00:10.910
It's not a bad thing.

00:10.910 --> 00:15.200
Not for you and your sister
or for you two as priestesses.

00:15.200 --> 00:19.660
The battle against Sedona has just begun.

00:22.200 --> 00:24.300
As you can tell,

00:24.300 --> 00:27.380
your powers haven't been very stable since the day of the solar eclipse.

00:27.950 --> 00:32.340
And in order to battle Sedona, you guys are still lacking something important.

00:34.970 --> 00:36.550
What's wrong, Turtle?

00:55.380 --> 00:56.490
You're...

00:57.910 --> 00:59.670
my daughter!

01:04.880 --> 01:07.510
This is my daughter, Ichikawa.

01:09.250 --> 01:10.760
Daughter?!

01:10.760 --> 01:14.420
Haven't you been a stone for over a hundred years?

01:14.420 --> 01:20.410
In order to help the priestesses, we sea turtles are born with a special spirit in our blood.

01:20.410 --> 01:22.600
I don't really understand, but...

01:23.400 --> 01:25.920
Even when infected with Sedona's dark powers,

01:25.920 --> 01:30.990
we are still able to protect ourselves because of the power of the blood spirit.

01:45.290 --> 01:47.830
kimi to ireba

01:45.290 --> 01:47.830
If I’m with you -

01:47.830 --> 01:50.670
kimi to itara

01:47.830 --> 01:50.670
because I’m with you -

01:50.670 --> 01:55.300
kokoro ga yasuraku

01:50.670 --> 01:55.300
my heart is at ease.

01:56.260 --> 01:58.840
kimi mo soude

01:56.260 --> 01:58.840
Surely, you’re the same.

01:58.840 --> 02:04.390
kimi mo ima yasurakerute

01:58.840 --> 02:04.390
You’re at ease now, too.

02:05.430 --> 02:12.020
itekuretara ii noni

02:05.430 --> 02:12.020
If you can just admit it,

02:13.770 --> 02:17.360
sono mama

02:13.770 --> 02:17.360
for even time to forget us,

02:18.320 --> 02:31.500
jikan saemo wasuresouna kurai shizen dakara

02:18.320 --> 02:31.500
it’s only natural, at this rate.

02:32.250 --> 02:42.970
yubisaki kara koboreochiru violet wo yo

02:32.250 --> 02:42.970
Violet drops, falling slowly from our fingertips…

02:42.970 --> 02:49.850
chiisana yume egaite yukou

02:42.970 --> 02:49.850
“Let us follow that small dream with a smile!”

02:49.850 --> 02:55.780
futaride sasayaka na

02:49.850 --> 02:55.780
And just like that, we are happy

02:57.190 --> 03:01.410
kotoba ga ureshii

02:57.190 --> 03:01.410
over such trifling words

03:01.910 --> 03:06.120
somatteku sora

03:01.910 --> 03:06.120
that paint the sky.

03:23.050 --> 03:31.060
The Separating Hearts

03:28.560 --> 03:30.770
Thanks to the solar eclipse yesterday, I was able to make a lot!

03:30.770 --> 03:34.770
Today, Matsumoto-san and his daughter were reunited, so we have to make a feast!

03:34.770 --> 03:36.940
Sorry for the trouble, Miyako-san.

03:38.070 --> 03:40.490
Don't be shy! Eat up!

03:41.110 --> 03:46.030
She's your daughter, yet she's called Ichikawa-san.

03:47.610 --> 03:50.760
Could it be that she was adopted?

03:50.750 --> 03:54.210
Or should I not ask these questions?

03:54.630 --> 03:57.390
Well, it's a long story.

03:58.420 --> 04:00.920
You've never eaten pickles before?

04:00.940 --> 04:03.300
We made them ourselves!

04:03.300 --> 04:06.470
You didn't have to bring out this much.

04:11.640 --> 04:13.270
Ah, you can tell!

04:13.270 --> 04:16.610
This is a recipe that has been passed down for generations!

04:17.020 --> 04:20.580
Today's bitter melon is really good!

04:21.280 --> 04:24.570
I really wanted Urin-chan to try it, too...

04:28.700 --> 04:31.620
I really should go get Urin.

04:31.620 --> 04:34.420
Hey, Marin! Wait!

04:35.330 --> 04:36.540
Why?

04:36.920 --> 04:38.840
Well, it's just that...

04:39.420 --> 04:42.010
I wish it was only my imagination, but...

04:42.960 --> 04:48.920
I saw this butterfly shape on Urin's hand yesterday.

04:51.390 --> 04:52.600
What?!

05:25.630 --> 05:27.970
What's all this about, Turtle?

05:27.970 --> 05:31.180
That butterfly is the mark of Sedona.

05:31.180 --> 05:34.020
If my prediction is correct,

05:34.020 --> 05:37.690
Your sister was invaded by the dark butterflies during that solar eclipse.

05:40.110 --> 05:45.320
Sedona has taken control of her inner self.

05:45.900 --> 05:47.240
Why?

05:47.730 --> 05:49.650
I have a bad feeling about this.

05:49.660 --> 05:53.200
The blood of the priestess should have been passed down to your sister, too.

05:53.200 --> 05:59.170
If Sedona uses her, she would attain a powerful energy.

05:59.660 --> 06:02.620
Why does everyone bully Urin?

06:03.630 --> 06:06.050
We've always had a good relationship...

06:06.050 --> 06:09.930
No! The Sky is a scary place!

06:09.930 --> 06:11.800
The Sky people are really mean!

06:11.800 --> 06:13.220
Onee-chan!

06:13.220 --> 06:15.980
Urin! I'm so glad!

06:18.640 --> 06:20.900
Onee-chan!

06:25.780 --> 06:28.240
Urin! You're so cute!

06:35.190 --> 06:36.660
Urin.

06:37.290 --> 06:40.000
Right now, Sedona does not have a body,

06:40.000 --> 06:45.250
so she cannot open the other half of the sealed grave.

06:45.840 --> 06:50.220
But one who has the blood of the priestess, such as Urin, can.

06:50.220 --> 06:54.050
So Sedona took control of her.

06:54.050 --> 06:58.020
I have to go back to the Sea to save Urin!

06:58.810 --> 07:00.560
Marin, wait!

07:02.700 --> 07:04.560
Wait!

07:05.770 --> 07:10.490
You must stay. You cannot enter the Sea since you're the Priestess of the Sky.

07:10.490 --> 07:11.030
But...

07:11.570 --> 07:13.660
You have other things to deal with.

07:13.660 --> 07:16.490
You have to look for the Ortelius Ring.

07:16.990 --> 07:18.910
Or... O-Ort.... Ortel...

07:19.200 --> 07:21.370
Ortelius Ring.

07:21.370 --> 07:24.210
It can allow the Priestess of the Sky to enter the Sea.

07:24.710 --> 07:28.210
You will use to fight Sedona.

07:28.210 --> 07:29.760
Where is it?

07:30.340 --> 07:32.380
I don't know.

07:33.090 --> 07:37.180
But if you're a priestess of the Miyamori family,

07:37.180 --> 07:40.350
it should be hidden somewhere in your house.

07:42.350 --> 07:45.940
Kanon-chan, you don't have to come. I'll go by myself.

07:45.950 --> 07:47.270
Marin!

07:47.520 --> 07:51.280
My Daughter! You stay here with the Priestess of the Sky!

07:53.360 --> 07:55.910
Wait for me, Priestess of the Sea!

08:00.290 --> 08:02.330
The Ortelius Ring...

08:03.120 --> 08:06.090
Well then, I have to look for it!

08:07.960 --> 08:10.340
Hi, sir, Manjiro!

08:11.340 --> 08:12.930
Oh, the Miyamori girl.

08:17.640 --> 08:18.560
A turtle?

08:20.720 --> 08:23.520
Does this ring exist?

08:23.850 --> 08:24.940
Not this.

08:25.820 --> 08:26.780
Gosh!

08:26.780 --> 08:28.220
What are you doing?

08:28.840 --> 08:29.650
Mom!

08:30.110 --> 08:34.110
Do we have anything valuable that has been passed down by our ancestors?

08:35.160 --> 08:37.700
You need it for fortune-telling?

08:38.080 --> 08:43.000
Of course. Each generation has its own tools for fake fortune-telling.

08:43.000 --> 08:45.080
Don't say that we're fakes!

08:45.350 --> 08:47.080
For example, a good luck stamp.

08:47.330 --> 08:50.420
Or a cow leg that grants wishes.

08:50.440 --> 08:52.920
Or a centipede that can predict disasters.

08:52.920 --> 08:54.800
Like I said, not fake fortune-telling tools!

09:01.470 --> 09:04.440
If Sedona is invading Urin's heart,

09:04.440 --> 09:08.150
she will be asleep at the shrine where the other half is.

09:09.110 --> 09:11.070
Urin.

09:27.620 --> 09:28.790
We're here.

09:30.380 --> 09:34.010
Can you feel the power of Sedona, Priestess of the Sea?

09:34.010 --> 09:37.590
Yes. It makes it hard to breathe.

09:37.590 --> 09:40.100
It's a terrible and scary power.

09:40.640 --> 09:44.770
Is this the power Urin was talking about?

09:44.770 --> 09:49.440
Marin! Elder! You guys came back!

09:49.780 --> 09:51.670
Warin! Sam!

09:53.480 --> 09:57.780
Anyway, I found everything in the house that looks like it.

09:57.780 --> 10:00.370
So? Is it any of these?

10:02.240 --> 10:04.040
Don't know, huh...

10:04.750 --> 10:07.370
In that case, I'll just have to try them all!

10:07.750 --> 10:10.580
Okay! I'll start with this.

10:23.260 --> 10:24.520
I'll die at this rate!

10:27.310 --> 10:28.100
Next!

10:37.950 --> 10:39.400
Nope, this isn't working!

10:40.010 --> 10:41.180
What are you doing?

10:42.230 --> 10:43.830
K-Kojima! What are you doing here?

10:44.200 --> 10:47.450
Well, I called you, but you didn't answer,

10:47.450 --> 10:49.250
so I wanted to talk to you directly.

10:49.790 --> 10:52.670
I don't have anything to talk to you about.

10:53.670 --> 10:56.170
Besides, is it okay for you to leave Ooshima alone?

10:56.630 --> 11:00.380
Ooshima? Wait, why are we talking about her?

11:01.180 --> 11:06.680
Anyway, go home. I'm kind of busy right now.

11:10.640 --> 11:12.270
This isn't it!

12:09.620 --> 12:11.460
What's wrong, Manjiro?

12:21.840 --> 12:23.800
What's going on?!

12:27.140 --> 12:28.100
Manjiro!

12:36.230 --> 12:38.980
Manjiro!

12:40.540 --> 12:44.530
The evil power is stronger than the last time we visited.

12:44.530 --> 12:45.660
Urin!

12:45.660 --> 12:50.490
Wait. It's dangerous for the Priestess of the Sea to go any further alone.

12:51.450 --> 12:53.960
Oh, yeah. Where is Kanon-chan?

12:54.250 --> 12:58.040
The Priestess of the Sky does not yet have the ability to fight in the Sea.

12:58.040 --> 13:00.550
Not without the Ortelius Ring.

13:01.420 --> 13:02.630
It's fine.

13:03.220 --> 13:04.380
Marin.

13:04.380 --> 13:05.930
I'm all right by myself.

13:08.100 --> 13:12.270
I guess you don't want to put her in danger.

13:12.270 --> 13:13.640
But if you guys don't work together...

13:13.640 --> 13:16.350
If Kanon-chan is here, Urin won't come back!

13:17.600 --> 13:18.860
Marin!

13:19.650 --> 13:21.360
Wait, Priestess of the Sea!

13:29.030 --> 13:31.120
I looked everywhere I could.

13:31.120 --> 13:33.620
That turtle isn't trustworthy.

13:34.000 --> 13:35.910
So hot...

13:44.340 --> 13:47.050
She actually likes pickles. What a weird turtle.

13:47.050 --> 13:50.510
Well, ours are special...

13:52.560 --> 13:53.390
No way!

13:53.770 --> 13:54.850
Ouch!

13:58.150 --> 14:02.900
The gold piece that has been passed down for many generations to make the pickles delicious!

14:06.190 --> 14:07.650
Could it be?

14:15.540 --> 14:18.830
It really is!

14:20.000 --> 14:22.670
Manjiro!

14:24.340 --> 14:27.720
Manjiro! Where are you?!

14:31.390 --> 14:32.970
I'm sorry, Ooshima.

14:33.930 --> 14:35.220
Don't worry about it.

14:35.220 --> 14:38.140
Someone gave me the tickets for this glass-bottomed boat.

14:38.140 --> 14:40.900
And I understand your feelings.

14:40.900 --> 14:43.150
I'm on your side.

14:43.610 --> 14:46.990
Miyamori-san doesn't have to act like that.

14:47.500 --> 14:49.740
She even took her ring off.

14:48.360 --> 14:50.950
Technique to make her breast look bigger!

14:49.740 --> 14:53.530
Really... How about just giving up on her?

14:54.410 --> 14:58.080
That would be great, but you can't do those kind of things.

14:58.100 --> 14:58.870
Yeah.

14:58.870 --> 15:02.330
Why don't you try starting a new relationship?

15:00.370 --> 15:02.330
A naughty angle

15:04.040 --> 15:05.050
Say, Ooshima.

15:05.050 --> 15:07.010
What is it, Kojima-kun?

15:07.010 --> 15:10.010
You said you like someone. Who is it?

15:11.760 --> 15:15.010
Of course I have someone I like, it's you!

15:15.010 --> 15:20.310
I was going to tell him, but it's stuck inside my mouth!

15:21.980 --> 15:24.690
I see. It's difficult for both of us.

15:26.020 --> 15:28.400
But you're a good person,

15:28.400 --> 15:29.740
so you shouldn't have any problems!

15:29.740 --> 15:30.740
A good <i>person?</i>

15:31.150 --> 15:32.240
Good person...

15:32.240 --> 15:34.910
No, this is my chance to step up and tell him.

15:35.490 --> 15:40.370
Kojima-kun... Actually, I like yo-

15:41.370 --> 15:42.330
Miyamori?!

15:49.380 --> 15:52.470
She's showing herself off in a swimsuit at a time like this!

15:52.470 --> 15:53.590
So pretty...

15:53.590 --> 15:54.850
She succeeded?!

15:55.260 --> 15:59.470
Damn you, Miyamori Kanon! Using dirty tricks like this!

15:59.470 --> 16:01.230
I will ruin you!

16:08.650 --> 16:11.650
I'm telling you, we should go back.

16:17.830 --> 16:21.790
Urin! If you're here, answer me!

16:22.080 --> 16:23.620
Not here?

16:23.620 --> 16:25.630
That's impossible.

16:25.630 --> 16:27.340
Then, why?

16:27.340 --> 16:28.710
Everyone, go back.

16:31.300 --> 16:35.970
Urin is my sister, so she wishes to see me alone.

16:36.340 --> 16:37.390
Marin.

16:39.390 --> 16:43.640
You guys don't have to worry about us. We can deal with this.

16:56.240 --> 16:57.780
Move back, Marin!

16:58.490 --> 16:59.620
Hey, Marin!

16:59.620 --> 17:00.660
Priestess of the Sea!

17:01.200 --> 17:04.870
I'm here to save Urin by borrowing the priestess's powers!

17:07.330 --> 17:08.040
Watch out!

17:10.500 --> 17:13.260
I can't transform... How come?!

17:17.930 --> 17:20.220
Turtle shell!

17:20.220 --> 17:21.560
Marin! Are you all right?

17:23.060 --> 17:24.310
Warin!

17:26.810 --> 17:27.940
Get out of my way!

17:38.410 --> 17:39.280
Marin!

17:39.280 --> 17:41.700
Hang in there, Priestess of the Sea!

17:44.410 --> 17:45.330
Urin...

17:50.040 --> 17:51.960
This is the end.

17:55.470 --> 17:58.590
O light of the clear sky, do as I command!

17:58.590 --> 17:59.840
Shine over the darkness!

18:04.180 --> 18:05.390
Are you all right?

18:05.390 --> 18:06.850
I can't transform...

18:07.850 --> 18:10.190
I wanted to save Urin...

18:10.190 --> 18:12.980
Why? I don't understand!

18:15.040 --> 18:16.440
Leave it to me.

18:20.030 --> 18:22.780
I'll give your method a try!

18:30.500 --> 18:32.170
Behave!

18:37.790 --> 18:39.180
What should I do?

19:23.890 --> 19:25.360
Manjiro.

19:36.270 --> 19:39.780
The Priestess of the Sky also has that ability?

19:39.780 --> 19:42.910
But Marin couldn't transform into a priestess.

19:42.910 --> 19:43.780
Sam!

19:43.780 --> 19:45.160
Oh, I'm sorry.

19:46.330 --> 19:47.370
Marin!

19:47.740 --> 19:49.540
Wait, Marin!

20:00.220 --> 20:02.970
Look there! There's a dog swimming!

20:02.970 --> 20:03.890
No way!

20:04.340 --> 20:05.850
Manjiro!

20:19.400 --> 20:22.700
This place contains a very unusual evil power.

20:23.240 --> 20:26.660
My heart feels colder just by moving closer to the shrine.

20:31.080 --> 20:33.120
The seal has been removed!

20:39.460 --> 20:40.590
That's...

20:48.220 --> 20:49.010
Urin!

20:55.600 --> 20:59.270
Urin, come over here! Let's go back!

21:00.020 --> 21:01.730
A little more...

21:02.360 --> 21:05.360
If I can acquire this power,

21:05.360 --> 21:08.700
I will be able to protect myself.

21:08.990 --> 21:12.120
No! You can't accept that power!

21:12.120 --> 21:16.120
I will be able to get my sister back from Kanon.

21:18.630 --> 21:21.500
Urin, I'm going to save you right now.

21:21.920 --> 21:23.590
Don't come any closer!

21:31.600 --> 21:33.850
Urin!

21:53.620 --> 21:58.370
Just a little more, Onee-chan...

22:26.530 --> 22:31.450
hikari no yurikago

22:26.530 --> 22:31.450
Within a droplet of water,

22:31.870 --> 22:34.990
shizuku no naka ni

22:31.870 --> 22:34.990
a cradle of light

22:35.330 --> 22:38.250
tojikometara

22:35.330 --> 22:38.250
is trapped.

22:38.250 --> 22:43.420
mizu no iro ni naru

22:38.250 --> 22:43.420
And so, it colors the water.

22:43.840 --> 22:47.050
mimi wo sumashite

22:43.840 --> 22:47.050
Clear your ears

22:47.050 --> 22:49.720
eien e

22:47.050 --> 22:49.630
to eternity.

22:49.720 --> 22:55.010
hitori de yume no ato

22:49.800 --> 22:55.010
Beyond a lonely dream,

22:55.010 --> 23:00.350
tsunaide yukeba

22:55.010 --> 23:00.350
if one connects with another,

23:01.060 --> 23:06.940
sotto kurikaesu kagayaki

23:01.060 --> 23:06.940
the repeating, soft shine

23:07.360 --> 23:11.990
warattemo attete

23:07.360 --> 23:11.990
meets and smiles,

23:11.990 --> 23:19.160
mou sukoshide kokoro ga todoku kara

23:11.990 --> 23:19.160
and with just a little more, the hearts have been reached.

23:19.160 --> 23:23.880
toumeina inori de

23:19.160 --> 23:23.750
With a transparent prayer,

23:23.880 --> 23:33.220
yasashiikuchikamu wo tsutsumuyo

23:23.880 --> 23:33.220
concealed within a gentle mouth.

23:35.740 --> 23:36.420
Did you know?

23:36.430 --> 23:39.930
The Triplewart Seadevil is a hermaphrodite.

23:39.930 --> 23:40.600
T-Triplewart?

23:40.600 --> 23:42.690
It's "Triplewart Seadevil!"

23:42.690 --> 23:43.650
I want to know.

23:43.650 --> 23:45.440
Next time, Episode 8:

23:45.460 --> 23:47.150
Hearts Seeking Help.

23:47.150 --> 23:49.940
I love everyone!
